    {
      "id": "claim_110cf0d6d542401a958eb7f4c382348a",
      "statement": "The migrations/ directory contains hand-written, manually-applied SQL scripts (not run by any compose step or migration tool) used to alter existing tables, add constraints, backfill data, or create new tables/catalogs outside the create_all bootstrap; because Base.metadata.create_all only adds brand-new tables and never alters existing ones, any models.py change that modifies an existing table requires a corresponding manually-coordinated script in this directory.",
